DTSTART:20261021T221500Z
DTEND:20261021T231500Z
SUMMARY:First-Timers Meetup & SIG Welcome
DESCRIPTION:Whether this is your first\, fifth\, fifteenth\, or fiftieth time attending MCN\, all are invited to join us in welcoming the newest members of the MCN community who are attending MCN for the first time. Get loose and break some ice ahead of the evening's Ignite reception.\n\nCash bar; complimentary light fare will be available\n
CATEGORIES:SPECIAL EVENT
LOCATION:502 Cowlitz\, Seattle\, WA\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
UID:3d7f6b7e0d633de2fbd8217b8fe4a6d5@schedule
URL:http://mcn2026.sched.com/event/3d7f6b7e0d633de2fbd8217b8fe4a6d5
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20260729T200829Z
DTSTART:20261022T000000Z
DTEND:20261022T020000Z
SUMMARY:Ignite! Reception
DESCRIPTION:Our signature welcome event\, Ignite\, showcases a series of rapid-fire talks from creative thinkers in the museum field. Expect lots of energy with fresh\, inspiring\, and timely ideas from familiar faces and emerging voices in the field and beyond. Talks follow the “Ignite” format\, in which presenters have five minutes and 20 slides (which advance automatically every 15 seconds) to enlighten\, entertain\, and inspire. Hear from several brave and visionary speakers sharing their experiences in a wide variety of disciplines. \n\nOne Team: Better Museums Through Collaboration\nMiranda Kerr\n\nLessons In Risk Management from an Avid Baker\nIsabel Cuellar\n\nGetting There: Female Pleasure as a Model for Transformative Museum Experiences\nSarah Wambold\n\nBefore I Tell You What I Learned\nSherman Bausch\n\nCan Technology Replace My Mom?\nNina Callaway\n\nMuseum Network Mycelium Network\nAndrea Montiel de Shuman\n\nCan We Still Trust Digital History\nSonya Norman\n\nHow to Touch Grass\nMaría-Elisa Heg\n\nThis reception is included in the registration cost; no separate ticket is required. Light appetizers and beverages will be provided. Each attendee will get one drink ticket.\n\n
CATEGORIES:SPECIAL EVENT
LOCATION:The Point at Pier 70\, 2801 Alaskan Wy\, Seattle\, WA 98121
SEQUENCE:0
UID:1b3bd551eceb27b145e3fc07e531d68f@schedule
URL:http://mcn2026.sched.com/event/1b3bd551eceb27b145e3fc07e531d68f
END:VEVENT
